flowchart LR
    U[学习者] --> W[React Web]
    W --> API[FastAPI API]

    API --> DOC[文档流水线<br/>解析 · 切分 · 建库]
    API --> AGENT[有界工具 Agent<br/>白名单 · 最多 8 轮]
    API --> LOOP[自适应学习闭环<br/>路径 · Quiz · 批改]

    DOC --> RETRIEVAL[(Chroma + BM25)]
    AGENT --> TOOLS[业务工具注册表]
    TOOLS --> RETRIEVAL
    AGENT <--> HITL[HITL 中断 / 恢复]

    LOOP --> STATE[(PostgreSQL / SQLite)]
    AGENT --> STATE
    LOOP --> MEMORY[(Learner Memory)]
    MEMORY --> LOOP

    DOC --> MODEL[OpenAI-compatible APIs]
    AGENT --> MODEL
    LOOP --> MODEL

